nee hayaku kaette kite ne

00:22:49.321 --> 00:22:52.991
Master, I filled in the holes in front of the house.

00:22:52.991 --> 00:22:54.791
Oh, thanks!

00:22:54.791 --> 00:23:00.631
Also, you're no longer the lowest ranked hero.
You've gone up from 388th to 342nd.

