00:23:01.631 --> 00:23:03.801
Oh? Because of that Panic guy?

00:23:03.801 --> 00:23:05.341
Guess he boosted my ranking.

00:23:07.301 --> 00:23:09.011
So it's been a week now.

00:23:09.011 --> 00:23:10.511
Have you done anything?

00:23:10.511 --> 00:23:12.801
No, not yet.

00:23:12.801 --> 00:23:14.811
I guess it has only been a week.

00:23:14.811 --> 00:23:18.521
I'm still ranked last in Class S
for ability… 17th place.

00:23:19.441 --> 00:23:22.111
Sounds like you've still got
a lot of training to do, Genos.

00:23:23.901 --> 00:23:27.651
But in the public polls,
I rank sixth for popularity.

00:23:28.401 --> 00:23:30.031
Why?!

00:23:30.031 --> 00:23:33.331
"A genius who, at the tender age of 19,
made his debut in Class S."

00:23:33.331 --> 00:23:34.411
"He'll do great."

00:23:34.411 --> 00:23:35.791
"He's so handsome."

00:23:35.791 --> 00:23:38.411
"Love how he refuses to do
media interviews. Very cool."

00:23:38.791 --> 00:23:40.461
That's what the comments say.

00:23:40.461 --> 00:23:43.421
Aren't you embarrassed to read those aloud?

00:23:43.751 --> 00:23:49.221
These comments are based on impressions from my photo, not evaluations of me.

00:23:49.221 --> 00:23:50.511
I think nothing of them.

00:23:50.511 --> 00:23:51.891
Oh yeah?

00:23:51.891 --> 00:23:52.801
They continue.

00:23:52.801 --> 00:23:54.301
"The Cyborg Prince."

00:23:54.301 --> 00:23:56.811
"Behind the steely exterior, I feel his fragile soul."

00:23:56.811 --> 00:23:58.351
"Among the top five handsomest heroes."

00:23:58.351 --> 00:24:00.061
Enough already!

00:24:00.061 --> 00:24:20.081
