TIME

00:24:00.061 --> 00:24:20.081
THE
GREATEST
APPRENTICE

00:24:00.731 --> 00:24:02.441
This is Fubuki.

00:24:02.441 --> 00:24:05.321
Perhaps you know me better as the Blizzard from Hell?

00:24:06.231 --> 00:24:08.941
Well, I only had a small part this episode.

00:24:08.941 --> 00:24:11.201
Next time, on One Punch Man : Episode 7,

00:24:11.201 --> 00:24:12.611
"The Greatest Apprentice."

00:24:14.201 --> 00:24:16.281
The Blizzard Bunch will finally make its appearance.

00:24:16.281 --> 00:24:18.951
Miss Fubuki, we're not scheduled
to appear next week!

00:24:18.951 --> 00:24:20.081
That can't be right!
